   "sourceHash": "650e7f84c17a9e276935d463993a1f0bff6155885d5f167a11a64c1d48948563",
   "text": "– 请注意申请和出行方面的严格条件（详见“申请资格”部分）。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
