   "sourceHash": "7567f57542ae0dbaff897779bfc98245d77e5b64fd7cbc2dae7d3a8b303dd792",
   "text": "– 电子签证仅适用于停留不超过30天的入境。如您计划在印度停留更长时间，需要在您所在国家的印度签证申请中心申请旅游签证。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_e5b66a9ffd4850074043",
   "sourceHash": "e5b66a9ffd48500740435757687e7625c20a31e9e59ce2df0eaa7d183a1b71b0",
   "text": "填写签证申请时，您需要在申请表末尾的“当地联系人”部分填写以下信息：",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_fb57c3f04f3ffdf04c54",
   "sourceHash": "fb57c3f04f3ffdf04c5481eacb6e063a52df98439e303668d64d9673a6531b8f",
   "text": "Fragrant Nature Retreat & Resorts Pvt Ltd.[[TAG_1]]CP II/709, Nedungolam P.O, Paravur –[[TAG_2]]Kollam, Kerala, India PIN:691334.",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": "Company proper name and postal address kept verbatim in Latin script for courier use.",
   "issues": [
    "'Resorts' retained only because it is part of the registered company name."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t_610b5fc54bfbe499b484",
   "sourceHash": "610b5fc54bfbe499b4846aa0c5e347d33d80102a10878a7f1e657ffadbec1202",
   "text": "请注意，以上信息可能随时变更。请始终以 https://indianvisaonline.gov.in/visa/tvoa.html 为准，这是官方的在线签证网站。据报道，还存在其他非官方网站，出行人士应多加留意。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_e6bbcd066f49b1849db3",
   "sourceHash": "e6bbcd066f49b1849db39f42768a864a818b11cea10fbaedcb18c86633d77b88",
   "text": "您的签证申请表可能要求您填写入境和离境日期。为防途中出现延误或其他问题，我们建议您将入境日期填写为比计划日期提前几天，将离境日期填写为比计划日期推后几天。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_04afcf5c3c77f4c295fc",
   "sourceHash": "04afcf5c3c77f4c295fcb56c17d59fe1c7fad1534eac939e3a9d1030dc03a364",
   "text": "如果您希望委托代理机构办理签证，我们推荐 Vina Visas：www.vinavisas.com",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
