   "sourceHash": "c44a563aa2eeb93569d7ae6031ce25d115e88055fd2182c271f01c7d82325a57",
   "text": "2晚[[TAG_1]]Old Lighthouse Bristow Hotel，Fort Kochi（科钦堡）",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_74790aad3eed40955e83",
   "sourceHash": "74790aad3eed40955e83d6d656eccc2f40050841337120b20dbacef1dcf943ec",
   "text": "8晚[[TAG_1]]本次静修活动在喀拉拉邦的 Ayurvedic Healing Village 举办。了解更多信息，请访问：https://www.ayurvedichealingvillage.com/",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_e4eb18069d65aaa901ce",
   "sourceHash": "e4eb18069d65aaa901cecb66371155f389643796428e9d54c5f5127c91ab3fdc",
   "text": "饮食",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_6f07f3ca62ee6bb03a40",
   "sourceHash": "6f07f3ca62ee6bb03a40118b05fc492bb730cc3e68947ed650a0b1b412f8d67a",
   "text": "美味的喀拉拉风味餐食，按照传统阿育吠陀原则烹制，选用静修中心自有农场出产的无农药食材。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_06b59e2c60066e4c7a38",
   "sourceHash": "06b59e2c60066e4c7a380b3a97e19409bbdd731396f97858aafc845465e1719a",
   "text": "交通方式",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_590d94fea65832188255",
   "sourceHash": "590d94fea65832188255072cb581a5faa317a54d33bedfb12f57676703ac773f",
   "text": "最近的机场为科钦机场。费用不含机票。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_c1c281344147040c2c3c",
   "sourceHash": "c1c281344147040c2c3ce115193e82ea814a545ddd910f16712b59a1c90bdde0",
   "text": "如果您希望与老师同机出行，Emily 将乘坐新加坡航空[[TAG_1]]11月14日（周四）09:10 乘 SQ256 航班从布里斯班出发前往科钦（经新加坡中转）[[TAG_2]]22:05 抵达科钦国际机场",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_d838ad0c4fac59c87bc0",
   "sourceHash": "d838ad0c4fac59c87bc0d5268f65d1219943b311a5878bc238cd77bff7e7b762",
   "text": "返程[[TAG_1]]11月24日（周日）22:55 乘 M1467 航班从科钦出发前往布里斯班（经新加坡中转），于11月25日 16:55 抵达。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "Source typos ('at at', 'the the') not reproduced."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t_66e73bede43864f9e7ea",
   "sourceHash": "66e73bede43864f9e7ea60c2806a51cd4b087826163ad7d6218ea5c220fc08a6",
   "text": "Emily 是一名瑜伽与正念老师，也是认证的整体健康教练。作为业内公认的专家，她在 www.fmtv.com 上的节目广受观众好评，与 Deepak Chopra、Wayne Dyer 和 Dr Bruce Lipton 等业界领军人物同台亮相。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_0ae4faeb9665719b524f",
   "sourceHash": "0ae4faeb9665719b524fc0bd5f3baca4cae97b9ba24db3addfafaa487c8e5bd7",
   "text": "Emily 拥有十年教学经验，同时也是一名在全球各地不断求学的瑜伽学生，接受过哈他瑜伽（Hatha）和流瑜伽（Vinyasa flow）的正规培训。她将这两种风格巧妙融合，形成了自己深受喜爱的瑜伽课程。这种“融合”风格动静相宜、刚柔并济：一段流动练习会让您身体发热、塑造精实肌肉，下一段则以缓慢、舒展的修复序列让您沉浸于深度放松之中。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_8f0e80c05d6f800ef0a6",
   "sourceHash": "8f0e80c05d6f800ef0a6b86fae3e0237d6655067f89c6baf671ac08e00549422",
   "text": "“我很喜欢看到瑜伽给学员带来的深远影响——从他们踏上瑜伽垫的那一刻，到摊尸式（Savasana）后睁开双眼之时，转变悄然发生。作为两个年幼孩子的母亲，以及在我之前的企业工作中，瑜伽对我都弥足珍贵。无论您身处何种境况，瑜伽都能帮助您应对人生的起起落落。能与您分享这份礼物，是我的荣幸。”",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
